<title>UK: IADB sets 400 mln Dkr bond due December 2002.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 400 mln Dkr bond due December 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas Lux.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE   S14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
